      "writtenOn": "2019-01-23T07:43:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We can do this, but :\n・It\u0027s not like missing to close a cursor will leak resources. The cursor will be garbage collected and resources freed up eventually.\n・I tried doing that in other places and thought the code was less readable, which is why I left it as is. In this new code it would be easier to justify, but then we\u0027d lose consistency.\n\nBut I don\u0027t have a strong opinion either way. If you feel this is really an improvement I\u0027ll do it.",
      "parentUuid": "d16717e9_d0d4dc16",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 492,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 492,
